<div id="A4.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Please note that for fine-tuning DeepSeek, we leverage reasoning as an intermediate tool to generate better evaluations. This prompt guides the model to produce step-by-step reasoning on the submission, focusing on entity types, relationship types, and participation constraints.</p>
</div>
