<section id="A4.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.3 </span>Evaluation prompt</h3>

<div id="A4.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To evaluate feedback quality from the GPT-4o and our fine-tuned DeepSeek model on modeling mistakes, we use GPT-4o as an automated judge. For each test instance, a structured prompt analyzes feedback against ground-truth mistakes, classifying detections (true positives), misses (false negatives), hallucinations (false positives), extracting phrases, suggesting ideal feedback, and computing metrics (TP, FN, FP, precision, recall, F1-score). The prompt is as follows:</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<div id="A4.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_JSON ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx128" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1</span>
              
              
            <span id="lstnumberx128.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx129" class="ltx_listingline">
